den secrets, and unlock dozens of achievements. Master a fast-paced arsenal, from powerful melee combat to <strong>Akimbo Weapons</strong>, and enhance your abilities by unlocking <strong>Blessings </strong>and\u00a0<strong>Miracles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After unlocking everything, <strong>prestige </strong>to prove your mastery\u2014each prestige level increases the number of perks you can equip at once, letting you build even deadlier loadouts. Climb the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, competing for <strong>highest wave, fastest speedruns, and top prestige ranks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your monk with a variety of unlockable <strong>hats and heads</strong>, and personalise your arsenal with <strong>weapon camos</strong>. Whether you prefer a menacing look or something more stylish, there\u2019s always a way to stand out in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Wave.png?t=1752601301\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Defend.gif?t=1752601301\" /></div>The classic wave-based zombie survival formula you know and love\u2014amped up with high-speed movement and a retro twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/TestYourSkill.png?t=1752601301\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/mobility.gif?t=1752601301\" /></div>Master a fast-paced movement system where agility is your greatest weapon! <strong>Harness the Kinetic Energy system</strong>, gaining increased firepower and melee speed as you stay on 